WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:16.272
The Kids Central summer campers were eating lunch outside.

2
00:00:16.273 --> 00:00:18.646
But Jason wasn't eating.

3
00:00:18.647 --> 00:00:22.369
"What's the matter, Jason?" Mr. Dunn asked.

4
00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:25.103
"You're not hungry today?"

5
00:00:25.104 --> 00:00:29.605
"I'm hungry," Jason said, poking at his zucchini.

6
00:00:29.606 --> 00:00:34.002
"But I'm really sick of zucchini.

7
00:00:34.003 --> 00:00:38.140
We have a lot of it in our garden now.

8
00:00:38.141 --> 00:00:41.031
My mom makes me eat it every day!"

9
00:00:41.032 --> 00:00:43.586
Mr. Dunn looked shocked.

10
00:00:43.587 --> 00:00:48.036
"Really? You're sick of zucchini?"

11
00:00:48.037 --> 00:00:52.408
"I love zucchini," said Bobby.

12
00:00:52.409 --> 00:00:55.581
"It's not that bad," Izzie added.

13
00:00:55.582 --> 00:00:58.746
"Just eat it, Jason."

14
00:00:58.747 --> 00:01:00.952
"No wait—don't!"

15
00:01:00.953 --> 00:01:05.484
Mr. Dunn suddenly covered Jason's zucchini with his hand.

16
00:01:05.485 --> 00:01:08.203
Everyone stared at Mr. Dunn.

17
00:01:08.204 --> 00:01:11.451
"What's wrong?" asked Jason.

18
00:01:11.452 --> 00:01:14.939
"I just remembered," said Mr. Dunn.

19
00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:20.149
"We're making something today that might help you enjoy the zucchini!"

20
00:01:20.150 --> 00:01:24.001
Mr. Dunn started cleaning up his lunch.

21
00:01:24.002 --> 00:01:27.535
"I'm going to grab our supplies," he said.

22
00:01:27.536 --> 00:01:30.574
"Can I help?" Jason asked.

23
00:01:30.575 --> 00:01:39.823
"Sure. You can help me carry some things," Mr. Dunn said.

24
00:01:39.824 --> 00:01:44.864
In the gym Mr. Dunn picked up two bags.

25
00:01:44.865 --> 00:01:49.336
He pointed to the long extension cord and blender on the table.

26
00:01:49.337 --> 00:01:53.196
"Can you carry those things?" he asked.

27
00:01:53.197 --> 00:02:00.791
"Sure." Jason picked them up and followed Mr. Dunn outside.

28
00:02:00.792 --> 00:02:05.328
"We're going to make a magic dip," Mr. Dunn said.

29
00:02:05.329 --> 00:02:10.170
"It will help you eat zucchini and other vegetables you don't like."

30
00:02:10.171 --> 00:02:12.715
Ethan made a sour face.

31
00:02:12.716 --> 00:02:16.756
"Even cauliflower?" he asked.

32
00:02:16.757 --> 00:02:21.175
"Absolutely cauliflower," Mr. Dunn answered.

33
00:02:21.176 --> 00:02:24.795
"What's in the magic dip?" Ethan asked.

34
00:02:24.796 --> 00:02:28.629
"Jason, please show us what's in the grocery bag."

35
00:02:28.630 --> 00:02:33.894
Mr. Dunn set the bags on the table.

36
00:02:33.895 --> 00:02:35.939
"Olive oil and roasted almonds,"

37
00:02:35.940 --> 00:02:39.806
Jason said, pulling two items out of the bag.

38
00:02:39.807 --> 00:02:42.942
"A lemon and garlic cloves."

39
00:02:42.943 --> 00:02:46.427
"That's it?" Ethan asked, surprised.

40
00:02:46.428 --> 00:02:51.699
"Nope," said Jason. "Here's salt and pepper too."

41
00:02:51.700 --> 00:02:59.654
"Boys," said Mr. Dunn, "can you squeeze the lemon to make three tablespoons of juice?

42
00:02:59.655 --> 00:03:10.849
Girls, can you measure one-third cup of olive oil?"

43
00:03:10.850 --> 00:03:15.351
Mr. Dunn plugged in the blender.

44
00:03:15.352 --> 00:03:19.604
"We can put in everything at once," he said.

45
00:03:19.605 --> 00:03:27.875
"Roasted almonds, garlic, lemon juice, and olive oil."

46
00:03:27.876 --> 00:03:33.132
Whrr! The blender hummed and spun.

47
00:03:33.133 --> 00:03:38.089
"Now let's add a little salt and pepper," said Mr. Dunn.

48
00:03:38.090 --> 00:03:41.695
"Nice and creamy," said Izzie.

49
00:03:41.696 --> 00:03:45.643
"Perfect for our dip," said Mr. Dunn.

50
00:03:45.644 --> 00:03:51.091
He spooned some dip onto a plate and handed it to Jason.

51
00:03:51.092 --> 00:03:53.665
"Now try your zucchini."

52
00:03:53.666 --> 00:04:02.971
Everyone watched Jason dip a zucchini stick into the dip.

53
00:04:02.972 --> 00:04:07.664
"Well?" Izzie burst out. "Do you like it?"

54
00:04:07.665 --> 00:04:11.918
Jason squeezed his eyes as he chewed the zucchini.

55
00:04:11.919 --> 00:04:15.051
"Yes!" he cried at last.

56
00:04:15.052 --> 00:04:20.442
"It's good. Try some!" he told everyone.

57
00:04:20.443 --> 00:04:27.168
"Success!" said Bobby.

58
00:04:27.169 --> 00:04:32.686
"Jason, what should we name our magic dip?" asked Mr. Dunn.

59
00:04:32.687 --> 00:04:36.329
"Kids Central Summer Dip," Jason said.

60
00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:47.457
"But I'm going to make this at home too!"

61
00:04:47.458 --> 00:04:59.023
[caption_out@
